{"ID":"20260916183232-25rho97","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-25rho97","tags":"MC,漫谈","title":"MC十年老兵报到！","type":"doc","updated":"20260927093902"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916183232-z1gdcl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-z1gdcl9","updated":"20260916183248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天，一个MC十年老萌新诞生了"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"http://qzonestyle.gtimg.cn/qzone/em/e402399.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n从哇达西初一的第一个晚自习上开始\n最好的同桌带我先下载盒子，再在盒子里下载游戏。同桌教得很好，贴心地先教我玩创造"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"http://qzonestyle.gtimg.cn/qzone/em/e400409.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用盒子一键生成的大别墅，还有各种一键几何体\n别墅里面刷了个小黑，以为是别的玩家\n以为一直往底下挖就能挖到地狱\n喜欢在基岩下面抬头飞，试着钻进下来的洞里\n喜欢用萤石搭楼梯搭到限制高度，然后搭个平台，把狗子带上去跟夕阳合照\n不知疲倦地手动做了一个超大平层，做到家人都睡着了，然后懒得做内饰了\n尝试天堂和孵龙\n在UC浏览器看的动画视频\n第一次看终末之诗\n有一次竟然在浏览器里下到了圣诞版本，自带地图有大钟和过山车\n也尝试过奶块\n在方块世界里重复建造了一次又一次大平层\n建大平层的时候很忘我"}]},{"ID":"20260916200626-7cxprw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916200626-7cxprw0","updated":"20260927093902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"Pasted image 20260331174018"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"/assets/Pasted%20image%2020260331174018-20260916200648-p8ymso8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}